nu;&epsilon;&lambda;&iota;ά, &kappa;ά&nu;&epsilon;&iota; &tau;&omicron; ά&rho;&omega;&mu;&alpha;... &alpha;&pi;&lambda;ά &alpha;&kappa;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;&mu;ά&chi;&eta;&tau;&omicron;!</span><br><br><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">🕯 &Alpha;ί&sigma;&theta;&eta;&sigma;&eta;: &Gamma;&lambda;&upsilon;&kappa;ό, &zeta;&epsilon;&sigma;&tau;ό, &epsilon;&theta;&iota;&sigma;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ό.<br></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">💛 &Iota;&delta;&alpha;&nu;&iota;&kappa;ό &gamma;&iota;&alpha;: Ό&tau;&alpha;&nu; &chi;&rho;&epsilon;&iota;ά&zeta;&epsilon;&sigma;&alpha;&iota; &mu;&iota;&alpha; &delta;ό&sigma;&eta; comfort (ή &alpha;&pi;&lambda;ά έ&nu;&alpha; cheat day &chi;&omega;&rho;ί&sigmaf; &theta;&epsilon;&rho;&mu;ί&delta;&epsilon;&sigmaf;!).</span></p><p>⏳ <strong data-start="610" data-end="630">&Delta;&iota;ά&rho;&kappa;&epsilon;&iota;&alpha; &kappa;&alpha;ύ&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf;:</strong> 35 ώ&rho;&epsilon;&sigmaf;</p><p class="has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color"><br></p><p class="has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color">💡 <strong>Tip:</strong> &Gamma;&iota;&alpha; &omicron;&mu;&omicron;&iota;ό&mu;&omicron;&rho;&phi;&eta; &kappa;&alpha;ύ&sigma;&eta;, &alpha;&phi;ή&sigma;&tau;&epsilon; &tau;&omicron; &kappa;&epsilon;&rho;ί &nu;&alpha; &lambda;&iota;ώ&sigma;&epsilon;&iota; &pi;&lambda;ή&rho;&omega;&sigmaf; &sigma;&tau;&eta;&nu; &pi;&rho;ώ&tau;&eta; &chi;&rho;ή&sigma;&eta; (&tau;&omicron;&upsilon;&lambda;ά&chi;&iota;&sigma;&tau;&omicron;&nu; 1 ώ&rho;&alpha;) &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &sigma;&tau;&iota;&sigmaf; &epsilon;&pi;ό&mu;&epsilon;&nu;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &mu;&eta;&nu; &xi;&epsilon;&pi;&epsilon;&rho;&nu;ά&tau;&epsilon; &tau;&iota;&sigmaf; 3 ώ&rho;&epsilon;&sigmaf;.</p><br><p><strong>&Omicron;&delta;&eta;&gamma;ί&epsilon;&sigmaf; &Kappa;&alpha;ύ&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf;:&nbsp;</strong>&Gamma;&iota;&alpha; &nu;&alpha; &kappa;&rho;&alpha;&tau;ή&sigma;&epsilon;&iota; &tau;&omicron; &kappa;&epsilon;&rho;ί &sigma;&omicron;&upsilon; ό&sigma;&omicron; &pi;&epsilon;&rh